mpany contributed </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_79508ecf-3361-43dc-b7d9-6a2929c49120" contextRef="C_4523e5ce-4a22-4c65-b22c-c80416c4f40c" name="us-gaap:DefinedContributionPlanEmployerMatchingContributionPercent" unitRef="U_pure" scale="-2" decimals="INF">100</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">% of each employee's contributions, up to the first </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_cfc227ce-7249-425d-9c65-a2e8274d05d1" contextRef="C_4523e5ce-4a22-4c65-b22c-c80416c4f40c" name="us-gaap:DefinedContributionPlanMaximumAnnualContributionsPerEmployeePercent" unitRef="U_pure" scale="-2" decimals="INF">3</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">% contributed by each employee, and </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_ee8326aa-775d-4beb-b424-2bae0037f12d" contextRef="C_4523e5ce-4a22-4c65-b22c-c80416c4f40c" name="us-gaap:DefinedContributionPlanEmployersMatchingContributionAnnualVestingPercentage" unitRef="U_pure" scale="-2" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">50</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">% of employee's contributions, for the next </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_a94166a5-fc54-4c91-8fa6-a3652d4bef9d" contextRef="C_4523e5ce-4a22-4c65-b22c-c80416c4f40c" name="us-gaap:DefinedContributionPlanEmployerMatchingContributionPercentOfMatch" unitRef="U_pure" scale="-2" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">2</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">% of employee contributions.  For 2024, the Company contributed </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_5b06afdb-3768-4981-be24-c7d175443f6c" contextRef="C_e2806cf8-f873-4c53-9e08-0ae2d6d705e2" name="us-gaap:DefinedContributionPlanEmployerMatchingContributionPercent" unitRef="U_pure" scale="-2" decimals="INF">50</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">% of employee&#8217;s contributions, up to the first </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_c35250af-38ce-4199-b514-5a73412e5cdb" contextRef="C_e2806cf8-f873-4c53-9e08-0ae2d6d705e2" name="us-gaap:DefinedContributionPlanMaximumAnnualContributionsPerEmployeePercent" unitRef="U_pure" scale="-2" decimals="INF">6</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">% contributed by each employee. Total contribution expense under this 401k plan was $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_585e5c1b-bc56-4eb2-b1c7-573db825bf6c" contextRef="C_4523e5ce-4a22-4c65-b22c-c80416c4f40c" name="us-gaap:DefinedContributionPlanCostRecognized" unitRef="U_USD" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">674,708</ix:nonFraction